  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Spirit Manipulation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have grown experienced with your cursed technique, giving you perfect control over your spirits and gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The amount of cursed spirits it takes for you to make a Wisdom saving throw increases to 20.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your cursed spirits cost is reduced by your Cursed Energy modifier (minimum cost of 1 CE).  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your DC for eating cursed spirits with a CR higher than your level is decreased by your Cursed Energy modifier  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can now summon cursed spirits as a bonus action.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
